{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44890","headline":"奉和段着作山居呈诸同志三首次本韵 一 · 无可","name":"奉和段着作山居呈诸同志三首次本韵 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香花怀道侣，巾舃立双童。\n解印鸳鸿内，抽毫水石中。\n履温行烧地，衣赤动霞风。\n又似朝天去，诸僧不可同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}